two new tools wired into the full tool system:
- web_search: DuckDuckGo search, returns titles/urls/snippets
- fetch_url: fetches a URL, strips HTML to plain text

salience scorer gains wants_research flag for research-intent detection.
tools recruited on questions or research cues, gated on casual chat.
reach_for_capability gains "research" option for on-demand escalation.

